msgstr "Kontrahent %s nie ma rachunku bankowego."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir/models/account_payment_order.py:0
msgid "Missing bank account on journal %s."
msgstr "Brak rachunku bankowego w dzienniku %s."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_pl_split_payment_hint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_move__l10n_pl_split_payment_hint
msgid ""
"PLN bill above 15 000 PLN gross with VAT from a Polish supplier, not marked "
"as split payment: check whether it covers goods or services from annex 15 to"
" the VAT act."
msgstr ""
"Faktura zakupu w PLN na kwotę powyżej 15 000 zł brutto, z VAT, od polskiego "
"dostawcy, bez zaznaczonej podzielonej płatności. Sprawdź, czy obejmuje "
"towary lub usługi wymienione w załączniku nr 15 do ustawy o VAT."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_pl_split_payment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_move__l10n_pl_split_payment
msgid ""
"Pay this vendor bill with the split payment mechanism (mechanizm podzielonej"
" płatności): the VAT part goes to the supplier's VAT account. Set "
"automatically for bills imported from KSeF when the supplier marked the "
"invoice with split payment (P_18A); otherwise tick it yourself."
msgstr ""
"Faktura zakupu zostanie zapłacona w mechanizmie podzielonej płatności: kwota"
" VAT trafi na rachunek VAT dostawcy. Przy fakturach pobranych z KSeF pole "
"zaznacza się samo, gdy dostawca oznaczył fakturę adnotacją „mechanizm "
"podzielonej płatności” (P_18A). W pozostałych przypadkach zaznacz je "
"ręcznie."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.model_account_payment_line
msgid "Payment Lines"
msgstr "Pozycje płatności"

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.model_account_payment_method
msgid "Payment Methods"
msgstr "Metody płatności"

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.model_account_payment_order
msgid "Payment Order"
msgstr "Zlecenie płatności"

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_pl_split_payment
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_move__l10n_pl_split_payment
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_payment_line__l10n_pl_split_payment
msgid "Split payment (MPP)"
msgstr "Podzielona płatność (MPP)"

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir/models/account_payment_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Split payment VAT amount of payment line %s must be positive and not above "
"the transfer amount."
msgstr ""
"Kwota VAT w podzielonej płatności (pozycja płatności %s) musi być dodatnia i"
" nie może przekraczać kwoty przelewu."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_pl_split_payment_hint
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_move__l10n_pl_split_payment_hint
msgid "Split payment may apply"
msgstr "Możliwy obowiązek MPP"

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir/models/account_payment_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Split payment needs the Polish NIP of %(partner)s (payment line %(line)s)."
msgstr ""
"Do podzielonej płatności potrzebny jest polski NIP kontrahenta %(partner)s "
"(pozycja płatności %(line)s)."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir/models/account_payment_order.py:0
msgid "Split payment needs the recipient NIP (10 digits), not \"%s\"."
msgstr ""
"Do podzielonej płatności potrzebny jest NIP odbiorcy (10 cyfr), a podano "
"„%s”."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir/models/account_payment_order.py:0
msgid "The payment order has no transfers."
msgstr "Zlecenie płatności nie zawiera przelewów."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir/models/account_payment_order.py:0
msgid "The transfer amount must be positive (%s)."
msgstr "Kwota przelewu musi być dodatnia (%s)."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"This bill is above 15 000 PLN gross. If it covers goods or services from "
"annex 15 to the VAT act, tick Split payment (MPP) before you pay it."
msgstr ""
"Ta faktura przekracza 15 000 zł brutto. Jeśli obejmuje towary lub usługi "
"wymienione w załączniku nr 15 do ustawy o VAT, przed zapłatą zaznacz "
"„Podzielona płatność (MPP)”."

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_payment_line__l10n_pl_vat_amount
msgid "VAT amount (MPP)"
msgstr "Kwota VAT (MPP)"

#. module: l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pl_account_payment_order_elixir.field_account_payment_line__l10n_pl_vat_amount
msgid ""
"VAT part of this transfer sent to the supplier's VAT account. For a partial "
"payment it is proportional to the paid amount."
msgstr ""
"Kwota VAT z tego przelewu, która trafia na rachunek VAT dostawcy. Przy "
"częściowej zapłacie jest proporcjonalna do zapłaconej kwoty."
